{"4544480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ninja Vanish", "steam_appid": 4544480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Billy falls asleep… and vanishes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pulled into a living dream, Billy becomes a ninja and must fight his way through a shifting world to find a way home. The forest is alive. It watches, reacts, and tests every move you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and battle your way through Forest World as you search for the first Stone of Eternity. Every path hides something. Every choice shapes your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore deeper, move smarter, and stay sharp. The dream will not let you leave easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to expect:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced side-scrolling gameplay focused on movement, timing, and control</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action combat against forest creatures, spirits, and trickster enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden story elements that reward exploration and curiosity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret paths, hidden areas, and collectible treasures throughout each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supporting characters who guide you and reveal more of the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle and trial mechanics based on rhythm, observation, and decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic environment that shifts and reacts as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grading system that tracks performance, encouraging replay and mastery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the Stones. Learn the rules. Find your way home.</strong></p>", "about_the_gam